{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一名中國籍潛水資深教練，疑在印尼保育水域使用魚槍射殺玳瑁海龜，甚至將其宰殺烹煮拍片上載網絡，影片引爆全球怒火。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"LoveThreads.Net_810699827_17901936270570059_5716924203912341529_n.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026kwrUbLVMu81789441849.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"LoveThreads.Net_810699827_17901936270570059_5716924203912341529_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">涉案中國公民Wei Shang身分為 AIDA 國際自由潛水組織的資深教練官。據悉，他近日前往西巴布亞省四王群島皮亞內莫的保育水域潛水，期間涉嫌違規使用具破壞性的魚槍，親手射殺一隻瀕危受保護的玳瑁海龜。Wei Shang事後更將海龜宰殺及烹煮，並把影片發布至社交平台。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-15-11h02m56s926.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026aQcYRxadVs1789441886.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-15-11h02m56s926.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-15-11h03m28s809.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Ucsmeya0gP1789441869.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-15-11h03m28s809.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片曝光後迅速在印尼及國際潛水社群瘋傳並引發極大公憤，當地原住民巡邏隊見狀即時向政府及警方舉報。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">印尼當局隨即展開行動。蘇拉威西島望加錫移民局局長蘇巴吉奧（Abdi Widodo Subagio）證實，移民局接獲四王群島縣政府的緊急通報及扣押請求後，於昨日（14 日）在哈桑丁國際機場鎖定 Wei Shang。官員趕在魏男登機離境前的最後一刻將其攔截扣留，目前已將案件移送當地司法機關深入調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T03:20:33.066403+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":388,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}